      "message": "Add SYSTEM_IRQ service group\n\nAdd a new SYSTEM_IRQ service group which allows application processors\nto receive external interrupts from platform microcontroller. The platform\nmicrocontroller can use this service group to forward platform interrupts\nor inject software generated interrupts.\n\nSigned-off-by: Anup Patel <anuppate@qti.qualcomm.com>",
